{
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Step 2: the intake form\nOpen your `thread-s01.bpmn` and save it as `thread-s02.bpmn`. Keep the process id `student-request`.\n\n1. *File → New file → Form (Camunda 8)*. Form ID: `request-intake`.\n2. Add the fields: text fields `studentName`, `studentId`, `studentEmail` (validation: email) and `course`; a select `requestType` with the values `postponement`, `recognition` and `certificate`; a number `days` (*Days of postponement*) that is hidden unless the type is postponement (*Hide if*: `requestType != \"postponement\"`); a text area `reason`.\n3. Save it as `request-intake.form` and deploy it (rocket icon).\n4. In the process, select the start event → *Form* → *Camunda Form (linked)* → form ID `request-intake`. Deploy the process.\n\nThen complete this task: the engine checks the start form of your latest version.",
      "id": "class_s02_intake_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Feedback.** {{fbIntake}}",
      "conditional": {
        "hide": "=fbIntake = null or fbIntake = \"\""
      },
      "id": "class_s02_intake_1"
    }
  ],
  "type": "default",
  "id": "class-s02-intake",
  "executionPlatform": "Camunda Cloud",
  "executionPlatformVersion": "8.9.0",
  "schemaVersion": 18
}
